OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 9, dies in two-vehicle crash
OL,4,Ain the Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old girl has died in a
OL,7,Ftwo-vehicle crash in the Highlands.
OL,9,FThe girl was a rear seat passenger in a
OL,10,FVW Polo involved in a collision with a
OL,11,FFord Ranger at about 17:30 on Wednesday
OL,12,Fon the A831 between Drumnadrochit and
OL,13,FCannich, south of Inverness.
OL,15,FPolice said she was pronounced dead at
OL,16,Fthe scene, and the driver and a front
OL,17,Fseat passenger of the Polo were taken
OL,18,Fto hospital for treatment.
OL,20,FThe road was closed for seven hours to
OL,21,Fallow for an investigation.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
